# No media under `.github/`

Do not attach, commit, or leave screenshot or video files under `.github/` (no `.github/assets`, no PR image dumps in that tree).

- Visual validation still belongs in the PR body: hosted/agent images and markdown embeds that are not files in `.github/`.
- Do not start committing that media somewhere else in this git repo as a substitute.
